  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFLA 2005-09 - IFLA ALP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFLA 2005-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFLA (International Federation of Library Associations) St&#xF6;d till programmen ALP och FAIFE. ALP:s roll &#xE4;r att identifiera och motverka problem som hindrar utveckling av biblioteks- och informationsservice, samt f&#xF6;rmedla strategier f&#xF6;r att l&#xF6;sa dessa problem.FAIFEs roll &#xE4;r att utveckla och fr&#xE4;mja normer och standards f&#xF6;r RTI inom biblv&#xE4;sendet, ITC etc. N&#xE4;ra samarbete med UNESCO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFLA: Support through ALP (Action for development through Libraries Programme) to library and information services in Africa, Asia and Oceania, and Latin America and the Caribbean: promoting literacy, life-long learning, bridging the digital divide, and sustainable development. Support to FAIFE (Free Access to Information and Freedom of Expression) for normative and advocacy work rel to IFLAs mission.</narrative>
  </description>
